一瞬 一瞬 が ときめく
Every single moment makes my heart flutter,

671
00:36:16,946 --> 00:36:19,046
両手 に 一杯 の 想い出
with memories filling both hands.

672
00:36:19,046 --> 00:36:22,426
確かめ 合え ば 寂しく ない から
If we confirm them together, we won't be lonely,

673
00:36:22,426 --> 00:36:23,526
繋げ 全 絆 の 結晶
connecting the crystal of all bonds!

674
00:36:23,526 --> 00:36:25,126
dear my fave ,

675
00:36:25,266 --> 00:36:27,126
「 がんばっ て ! 」 なんて 言え ない
I can't just say "Do your best!"

676
00:36:27,266 --> 00:36:29,126
「 大丈夫 」 の 三文字 で 伝わる か な …
I wonder if three words of "It's okay" convey it...

677
00:36:29,266 --> 00:36:31,186
day by day

678
00:36:31,186 --> 00:36:35,086
そう 、 君 の おかげ で 少し だけ 、 自分 を 好き に なれ た から
yes, thanks to you, I've come to like myself just a little bit more,

679
00:36:35,086 --> 00:36:38,346
君らしく keep smiling and enjoy yourself
Be yourself, keep smiling and enjoy yourself.

680
00:36:38,346 --> 00:36:40,406
心から願う私がいる、ひとりじゃない
I'm here wishing from the bottom of my heart, you're not alone.

681
00:36:41,306 --> 00:36:42,646
dear my fave ,

682
00:36:42,806 --> 00:36:44,666
「 大好き ! 」 を 集め た
Gathering up "I love you!"

683
00:36:44,806 --> 00:36:46,666
愛言葉 手紙 に 書い て 贈り ます
I'll write these words of love in a letter and send them.

684
00:36:46,806 --> 00:36:48,226
you made my life

685
00:36:48,386 --> 00:36:50,646
夢 で 終わら ない 君 だけ が 、 君 こそ が 起こす 奇跡
not ending in a dream—you alone, you are the one who creates miracles.

686
00:36:50,806 --> 00:36:54,386
you will always be the first star in my heart ☆彡

687
00:36:54,546 --> 00:36:56,686
信じ て 夜空 の よう に ずっと
Believing, just like the night sky, forever.

688
00:36:56,686 --> 00:36:58,286
i will follow you forever

689
00:36:58,426 --> 00:37:01,326
ありったけ の 愛 を 込め て “ ありがとう ”
putting in all my love: "Thank you."

690
00:37:01,486 --> 00:37:05,646
君 と いう たった 一つ の 奇跡 銀河 を 越え て 掛け合う フレーズ 輝か せ て
The single miracle that is you—crossing the galaxy, making our intersecting phrases shine!

691
00:37:05,786 --> 00:37:06,966
best wishes ,
best wishes,

692
00:37:42,556 --> 00:37:43,756
はい 、 という こと で
Yes, and with that,

693
00:37:43,756 --> 00:37:45,356
レター に し たー !
we made it into a letter!

694
00:37:45,456 --> 00:37:47,056
みんな コメント も いっぱい
