あの日の君がいつもそこにいたから 健気に続けなんだ
Because you of that day were always there, I could keep going valiantly.

779
00:43:54,976 --> 00:44:02,196
今日まで忘れないでね 私らの星座は君がいたから生まれた
Don't forget until today, our constellation was born because you were there.

780
00:44:18,036 --> 00:44:25,656
異次元では楽しすぎたから 私たちは毎日を笑った
In another dimension it was too much fun, so we laughed every day.

781
00:44:25,956 --> 00:44:33,316
弱音となり 不安となり 辛い肩を回して
Turning into weakness, anxiety, rolling our tired shoulders,

782
00:44:33,536 --> 00:44:41,036
自分らしく笑える場所を 気づけば闇に星は満ちた
A place where we can smile as ourselves, before we knew it the darkness was filled with stars.

783
00:44:41,336 --> 00:44:48,836
重ねる歌で 想いを刻め この白羽の城壁に
Engrave your thoughts with overlapping songs onto this white-feathered rampart.

784
