ほら 君がいるから輝く
Look, it shines because you are here.

787
00:45:19,172 --> 00:45:22,472
たとえ君がいつの時を生きても
Even if you live in any era,

788
00:45:22,872 --> 00:45:25,872
何かを好きになる気持ち
the feeling of falling in love with something,

789
00:45:25,872 --> 00:45:30,172
大切に歌い続けてね 僕らの星座
please keep singing it dearly, our constellation.

790
00:45:30,472 --> 00:45:34,272
ほら 君がいるから 生まれ夜空に輝き
Look, born because you are here, shining in the night sky,

791
00:45:34,272 --> 00:45:37,572
明日へとつながる
connecting to tomorrow.

792
00:45:45,872 --> 00:45:49,872
未来を目指すよ
Aiming for the future,

793
00:45:49,872 --> 00:45:53,872
ともに行こう
let's go together.

794
00:47:13,272 --> 00:47:16,872
始まりはきっと 一つの願い
Surely, the beginning is a single wish.

795
00:47:16,872 --> 00:47:20,572
それを抱いて 私たちは
Embracing that, we

796
00:47:20,572 --> 00:47:25,072
生まれた孤独な夜空 震える指で
with trembling fingers in the lonely night sky where we were born,

797
00:47:25,072 --> 00:47:30,072
天と地をつなげよう
let's connect heaven and earth.

798
00:47:34,572 --> 00:47:37,272
たとえ君がいつの時を生きても
Even if you live in any era,

799
00:47:37,272 --> 00:47:41,272
何かを好きになる気持ち
the feeling of falling in love with something,

800
00:47:41,272 --> 00:47:46,072
大切に歌い続けてね 僕らの星座
please keep singing it dearly, our constellation.

801
00:47:46,572 --> 00:47:50,072
ほら 君がいるから 生まれ夜空に輝き
Look, born because you are here, shining in the night sky,

802
00:47:50,072 --> 00:47:52,572
明日へとつながる
connecting to tomorrow.

803
00:48:02,072 --> 00:48:06,072
未来を目指すよ
Aiming for the future,

804
00:48:06,072 --> 00:48:10,072
ともに行こう
let's go together.

805
00:48:18,572 --> 00:48:22,272
はい ということで もうみんな分かってたと思いますけども
Yes, so, I think everyone already knew, but

